   title = "2026-08-14 — /planning/daily Focus Queue + Start Day button fixes"
   description = "Fixed the Daily Priorities (Focus Queue) on /planning/daily: it was empty because the ranking call used a non-existent TodoRanking->new constructor and a missing Model::Todo->get_all_todos_for_listing method, and the planning-projects query used an unregistered model('Ency'). Also fixed the Start Day button which did nothing because the JS dereferenced a missing dl-feedback node."
